# ---- concurrency INSIDE one build (optional — both default ON) ----
# GATES_PARALLEL runs the preview E2E smoke as a read-only lane BESIDE the review
# lenses instead of in front of them, joined before the fix round. It was 2m36s
# to 5m01s of measured dead gap per build (docs/RUN-BUILD-GRAPH.md, row 30a).
#   1 = the lane (default)   0 = the serial order this replaced, verbatim
#GATES_PARALLEL=1
# E2E_JOIN_MAX_S caps how long the fix round waits for that lane. Past the cap
# the build carries on with no verdict, and the answer is applied at the tier
# decision instead (and appended to the PR as a comment).
#   0 = uncapped, the same convention as BUILD_SLOTS=0. A value that is not a
#   whole number of seconds falls back to 600 and writes one ALERTS line.
#E2E_JOIN_MAX_S=600
# STAGE_TIMING writes one "STAGE-TIMING <stage> start= end= secs=" line per
# section to the build's pipeline.log. Deliberately a SEPARATE knob: turning the
# reorder off must not also blind the measurement that judges it.
#STAGE_TIMING=1

